    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27767" root="عب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُنْبَبٌ</span></b>  <i>Abundance of water.</i> (IAar, O, K.
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُبَابٌ</span>.]) The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is said by AM [and in
the O] to be augmentative. (TA.) [But it is
also mentioned in the K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عنب</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
The <i>foremost portion of a torrent;</i> (K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عنب</span>;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُنْبُبٌ</span>. (So in some copies of the
K and in the TA in that art.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A certain
plant.</i> (K.)

